{
  "id": "word-bit-identities",
  "goals": [
    "UInt64.toBitVec x = UInt64.toBitVec y for words built from shifts, masks, ors, and xors",
    "(x <<< k) ||| (x >>> (64 - k)) = UInt64.ofBitVec (x.toBitVec.rotateLeft k)",
    "(Library.Hashing.Sha256.rot (Library.Hashing.Sha256.low32 x) r).toUInt32",
    "Library.Bytes.byteOf (Library.Hashing.Words.bswap x) k",
    "((s >>> q) &&& 1 == 1) = bit s q.toNat",
    "a rewrite with a lemma about UInt64.ofNat n that fails on a literal such as 1377 : UInt64",
    "bitStep^[8] (r ^^^ (b &&& 0xFF)) = Library.Hashing.Crc.byteStep crc32Table r b for a bitwise step linear over GF(2)",
    "((x ^^^ y) &&& 1) * c = ((x &&& 1) * c) ^^^ ((y &&& 1) * c)",
    "(kernel) deterministic timeout after simp only [Function.iterate_succ_apply]",
    "((w <<< 8) + (v >>> 56)).toNat for bit fields joined with + instead of |||",
    "(mask s).testBit j = decide (j + 1 ∈ s)",
    "LeanExe.loop n init f = ((members m n.toNat).filter P).foldl step init",
    "zmod (zdiv (land a b) (pow2 k)) 2 = zmod (zdiv a (pow2 k)) 2 * zmod (zdiv b (pow2 k)) 2",
    "(A &&& B) / 2 ^ j % 2 = A / 2 ^ j % 2 * (B / 2 ^ j % 2) for natural numbers at a variable position"
  ],
  "modules": [
